1
00:02:05,676 --> 00:02:12,676
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:02:13,260 --> 00:02:14,390
Holofira!

3
00:02:15,145 --> 00:02:16,145
Holofira!

4
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:20,599
Holofira, open your eyes come on.

5
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:23,599
Holofira.

6
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:29,119
-I hope she never opens her eyes.
-Shut it, Hatun!

7
00:02:30,560 --> 00:02:34,119
Enough, get out Elcim. Come on, out.

8
00:02:50,080 --> 00:02:54,119
You, how did you learn about the crusaders?

9
00:02:54,120 --> 00:02:59,119
This is my land. I know
everything going on in here.

10
00:02:59,120 --> 00:03:03,119
Who are you? Who are you
to sneak around in my lands?

11
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:07,119
-Who?
-Do not be so sure.

12
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:11,119
-You will find out who I am.
-First..

13
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:15,599
..first, you will tell me where the
crusadery army will come from.

14
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:20,599
You will learn it by living through it with pain.

15
00:03:21,080 --> 00:03:24,119
Your people will be crushed in front of your eyes.

16
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:29,119
The person who will teach
you is right in front of you!

17
00:03:29,120 --> 00:03:32,119
So you are serious.

18
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:37,599
The only reason why I do not
kill you right here and now..

19
00:03:37,600 --> 00:03:41,119
..is because you know where my signs are.

20
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:47,119
All your loved ones will
die in front of your very eyes.

21
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:52,599
You will come to me begging.

22
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:15,119
Turahan.

23
00:04:34,560 --> 00:04:40,599
Turahan, my brother.
Quick, inform the others..

24
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:43,599
..they took the captives to Sahin Hill.

25
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:47,119
-Okay, Cerkutay Bey.
-Come on brother.

26
00:05:01,080 --> 00:05:06,119
These dogs attacked my
caravan. They killed Uraz Bey.

27
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:12,119
Let us attack. Let us break
these dogs, what's the hold up?

28
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:22,599
You will not be Osman’s death today.

29
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,599
You fall back when I go far enough.

30
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:27,599
Where are you running to?

31
00:05:35,080 --> 00:05:39,119
Clear each of my weak men, Osman.

32
00:06:16,560 --> 00:06:20,119
Where are these dogs heading to?

33
00:06:24,080 --> 00:06:26,599
Clashing sounds come from the tribe.

34
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:30,599
They are attacking Osman Bey. Alps, come on!

35
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:46,119
You should've let me kill her, Bala Hatun.

36
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:49,119
Holofira attacked my aunt.

37
00:06:50,080 --> 00:06:55,599
What do you mean killing?
What did you do Elcim Hatun?

38
00:06:55,600 --> 00:06:59,119
You do not know Holofira.
She doesn't do such a thing!

39
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:02,599
-This hatun blinded all of you.
-Enough, Elcim...

40
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:06,119
You are acting without thinking.

41
00:07:07,080 --> 00:07:13,119
Go have some air.
You do more harm than good here.

42
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:22,119
Kismet, close the door for Allah's sake!

43
00:07:24,080 --> 00:07:27,599
Mother, Gonca help me.

44
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:31,119
-Have her smell this.
-Alright.

45
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:53,119
My Allah, do not test me with such pain.

46
00:08:02,080 --> 00:08:07,599
Thank Allah, we are blessed.

47
00:08:18,080 --> 00:08:20,599
The dagger hit the necklace.

48
00:08:22,080 --> 00:08:24,359
My Allah, thank you.

49
00:08:39,558 --> 00:08:43,599
-Orhan.
-I am here

50
00:08:44,560 --> 00:08:48,599
I am here, my Holofira. Do not worry.

51
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:03,599
-Are you alright, my girl?
-I am alright, thank you.

52
00:09:03,910 --> 00:09:06,799
Alright then.
Sisters...

53
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:11,119
Sisters, take Holofira
and Olivia to prison.

54
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:18,599
I will question them.
They will stay in the cells...

55
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:20,599
...until the truth is revealed.

56
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:25,119
Neither me nor Holofira did anything.

57
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:33,119
-Sisters, come on.
-Holofira, say something

58
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:37,119
-Mother..
-Enough Orhan, I said what I said.

59
00:10:15,080 --> 00:10:18,119
-My Bey, are you alright?
-I am alright.

60
00:10:18,560 --> 00:10:22,599
-It was obvious this dog set you up.
-Let him set as many traps as he wants!

61
00:10:22,600 --> 00:10:28,119
Now, he wants the relics of Seljuks.

62
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:31,599
He says he will be on us
unless we give them up. Just wait.

63
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:34,599
First, he will give me what I want.

64
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:39,599
Konur, you will send alps after that dog Imren.
I want to know about those passages.

65
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:43,119
-As you command, my Bey.
-We will be on his neck.

66
00:10:43,120 --> 00:10:47,119
-Of course we will not let that dog go.
-What about the crusaders issue?

67
00:10:47,560 --> 00:10:51,599
-What does he say to that?
-This is the dog that made the deal possible.

68
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:57,119
However, we do not have much time.
Crusader army is coming towards us.

69
00:10:57,120 --> 00:11:00,599
That is why I will go to
Atranos. I will talk to that dog.

70
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:04,119
My Bey, they will do worse at the castle.

71
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:07,599
Pope and Olcaytu wants to unite and crush us.

72
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:11,119
-Of course we will not allow it.
-It seems..

73
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:15,599
...horses will gallop and grass will be crushed.

74
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:20,599
Do not worry, Gunduz Bey. We are not grass.

75
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:25,119
Thank Allah, we are a mighty tree. And
we have a thousand year old roots here.

76
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:29,599
That is why, we are the owner
of the tribe. We are the hunters.

77
00:11:30,080 --> 00:11:36,119
Those dogs are the one that
should be afraid. Everyone, to horses.

78
00:12:16,080 --> 00:12:19,599
They can not hide that many
women and children I think.

79
00:12:19,600 --> 00:12:22,599
Brother, the forest thickens ahead.

80
00:12:22,600 --> 00:12:24,599
There must be places to hide.

81
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:27,599
Let us check it out now.

82
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:32,599
-Solgur Aga!
-Yes, Turahan.

83
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:39,599
They took the captives at the road to Sahin Hill.

84
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:42,119
Cerkutay Bey went ahead.

85
00:12:42,120 --> 00:12:44,119
Let me go after them. Maybe I will find tracks.

86
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:48,119
Solgur Aga. Now, we need to be sneaky.

87
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:52,119
They call me "The Lion Hunter".
I know how to be sneaky..

88
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:53,599
..and claw my enemies!

89
00:12:53,600 --> 00:12:56,599
Praise be to you!
Brothers, this duty is important.

90
00:12:57,080 --> 00:13:00,599
-We need to be there quick.
-Come on then!

91
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:03,119
Now!

92
00:14:04,544 --> 00:14:05,994
O Allah!

93
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:56,119
Allah is the greatest!

94
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:32,599
Father! Father! Father!

95
00:15:36,080 --> 00:15:39,119
If he is even slightly harmed...

96
00:15:39,560 --> 00:15:43,119
...I will make you drown in your own blood.

97
00:16:00,080 --> 00:16:04,599
Come. Come here, my boy. My son!

98
00:16:09,560 --> 00:16:13,119
Praise be, praise be!

99
00:16:13,120 --> 00:16:17,119
-Don't be afraid.
-It's alright. It's alright.

100
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:23,119
It's alright, my boy. You are good. You are good.

101
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:43,599
Orhan Bey.

102
00:16:45,560 --> 00:16:50,119
I said you'd be in trouble
as long as she stayed in the palace.

103
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:52,599
-And what did you do?
-What did you do, hatun?

104
00:16:53,080 --> 00:17:00,119
Ha? I told you. I trust
Holofira as much as I trust you.

105
00:17:00,560 --> 00:17:03,599
Holofira you trust so much poisoned my aunt!

106
00:17:03,600 --> 00:17:05,598
My aunt is dying, Orhan

107
00:17:05,598 --> 00:17:08,117
Elcim Hatun!

108
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:13,117
I keep silent because I know this
impertinence of yours is due to your grief.

109
00:17:13,118 --> 00:17:17,598
But you should know my patience has limits.

110
00:17:17,598 --> 00:17:21,117
Your lover attempted to take my life.

111
00:17:21,118 --> 00:17:24,598
-And you say...
-Holofira didn't do that!

112
00:17:25,560 --> 00:17:29,119
Whoever did this, I will find her.

113
00:17:29,120 --> 00:17:32,599
And you will apologize to Holofira.

114
00:17:33,560 --> 00:17:36,119
Apologize?

115
00:17:37,080 --> 00:17:40,119
-That girl bewitched you!
-Enough!

116
00:17:40,560 --> 00:17:43,119
Orhan! Elcim!

117
00:17:46,080 --> 00:17:48,599
Pull yourselves togethe You are in the palace.

118
00:17:56,560 --> 00:17:59,119
Holofira didn't do such a thing.

119
00:17:59,120 --> 00:18:03,599
-Investigate this.
-Just think about your duty, Orhan Bey.

120
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:05,599
Stay safe.

121
00:18:05,600 --> 00:18:08,599
Investigate this, mother.

122
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:13,599
Let's go!

123
00:18:19,080 --> 00:18:21,599
Come on!

124
00:18:27,560 --> 00:18:30,599
You calm down, Elcim Hatun.

125
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:33,599
Don't let anger blind you.

126
00:18:33,600 --> 00:18:37,599
I'm not the blind one, but Orhan Bey is.

127
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:41,599
Love blinds him. He doesn't see the truth.

128
00:18:41,600 --> 00:18:45,119
The truth has many faces, girl.

129
00:18:45,560 --> 00:18:50,599
Orhan accepted marrying you
for his state despite his love.

130
00:18:52,080 --> 00:18:56,119
He wouldn't have done that if love blinded him.

131
00:18:57,080 --> 00:19:00,599
If it is Holofira who did that...

132
00:19:01,080 --> 00:19:04,599
...he will punish her himself.

133
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:08,119
She bewitched Orhan Bey.

134
00:19:08,120 --> 00:19:12,119
Orhan Bey won't follow justice, but his love.

135
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:16,119
It's you who should listen to reason
before Orhan.

136
00:19:17,080 --> 00:19:21,119
Anger has overwhelmed you. You can't use your mind.

137
00:19:23,080 --> 00:19:28,119
Control your anger, girl.
I want no other mistakes.

138
00:19:50,080 --> 00:19:52,119
-My Bey.
-Cerkutay.

139
00:19:52,120 --> 00:19:55,119
-We took the captives.
-Thank you, Cerkutay.

140
00:19:55,120 --> 00:19:58,599
Thank you. Thanks to Allah.

141
00:19:58,600 --> 00:20:01,119
You did a great job.

142
00:20:01,120 --> 00:20:03,599
Thanks to the alps' bravery.

143
00:20:04,560 --> 00:20:10,119
Alright. Tell them we will
give each one a house and a job.

144
00:20:10,560 --> 00:20:16,119
And we will meet all their
expenses. Tell them this too.

145
00:20:16,120 --> 00:20:19,119
-As you order, my Bey!
-Sorgun Agha.

146
00:20:19,120 --> 00:20:23,119
-Yes, my Bey?
-We will make Uraz tribe great again.

147
00:20:23,120 --> 00:20:29,119
Alps have started the preparations.
Even no birds will fly over it.

148
00:20:29,120 --> 00:20:34,119
If the flying bird is not one of us,
we will break his wings, for sure.

149
00:20:34,120 --> 00:20:37,599
Come on, alps? Come on!

150
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:46,599
Son, she keeps sweating. She
also puked. But she's not going better.

151
00:20:47,080 --> 00:20:50,599
The poison is in her blood, mother.
We need to find the cure quickly.

152
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:54,599
But I can't find the cure without
knowing what the poison is.

153
00:20:55,080 --> 00:20:58,119
I'm going out.
You stay with her.

154
00:21:07,560 --> 00:21:10,119
I know Holofira.

155
00:21:10,120 --> 00:21:14,119
She wouldn't do that. She would
never betray you, Bala Hatun.

156
00:21:15,560 --> 00:21:20,599
People sometimes may do
what doesn't suit them, Gonca.

157
00:21:20,600 --> 00:21:24,119
I didn't expect you to do it either.

158
00:21:28,080 --> 00:21:31,119
You're right, Bala Hatun.

159
00:21:32,560 --> 00:21:35,119
But not every family is like you.

160
00:21:35,120 --> 00:21:39,599
I said only one word to silence my mother,

161
00:21:40,080 --> 00:21:42,599
...to prevent her from doing worse.

162
00:21:44,080 --> 00:21:47,119
And I lost too much with one word.

163
00:21:49,080 --> 00:21:53,119
Holofira may have been deceived as well.

164
00:21:53,120 --> 00:21:57,599
-Her aunt may have used her, ha?
-Maybe.

165
00:22:00,080 --> 00:22:05,119
People can't choose their mother or families.

166
00:22:07,560 --> 00:22:14,599
But your children are really lucky. They
have their mother who always support them.

167
00:22:16,560 --> 00:22:20,599
My mother became her own power's slave, Bala Hatun.

168
00:22:20,600 --> 00:22:24,599
She even used her own children for this.

169
00:22:27,080 --> 00:22:31,599
She even left her child alone.

170
00:22:33,080 --> 00:22:35,430
The important thing
is to be able to see the

171
00:22:35,442 --> 00:22:38,119
mistake and give up on
the wrong way, my daughter.

172
00:22:38,120 --> 00:22:42,599
You are afraid of taking after your mother, right?

173
00:22:46,560 --> 00:22:51,119
Don't worry. Everything is here.

174
00:22:51,120 --> 00:22:56,119
If you keep this clean, you won't be like her.

175
00:23:43,080 --> 00:23:46,599
Look Holofira... I know you didn't do this.

176
00:23:47,080 --> 00:23:49,599
You are not a person who would kill someone.

177
00:23:49,600 --> 00:23:52,599
Thus, you must tell me the things you know.

178
00:23:52,600 --> 00:23:58,119
Why are you still silent? Tell
her that you are innocent! Speak!

179
00:23:58,120 --> 00:24:02,599
Holofira... You are making it harder, my daughter.

180
00:24:03,080 --> 00:24:05,599
You didn't do this, right?

181
00:24:05,600 --> 00:24:09,599
You are also saying it, Malhun
Hatun. Holofira would not do this.

182
00:24:09,600 --> 00:24:13,599
-You put us in dungeon for no reason.
-Then you speak, Olivia.

183
00:24:13,600 --> 00:24:18,119
Holofira didn't do it, you
didn't do it, who did it then?

184
00:24:18,120 --> 00:24:21,119
This is your palace.
You must know that.

185
00:24:21,560 --> 00:24:25,599
You never trusted us since we
arrived. You locked us in a room.

186
00:24:25,600 --> 00:24:29,119
We only got out with your sisters. Tell me...

187
00:24:29,560 --> 00:24:33,119
How could I poison that woman?

188
00:24:33,560 --> 00:24:36,119
But Holofira went out.

189
00:24:37,080 --> 00:24:41,119
Sisters were also with her. How
could she go to Elcim's room?

190
00:24:41,560 --> 00:24:44,599
I don't believe Holofira did this.

191
00:24:44,600 --> 00:24:50,119
But I will never trust you... If
you are the one who did this...

192
00:24:50,560 --> 00:24:52,967
...I won't forgive the one
who shed blood in my

193
00:24:52,979 --> 00:24:55,599
palace, and I will take
your life with my own hands.

194
00:24:57,080 --> 00:25:00,119
Malhun Hatun.

195
00:25:06,080 --> 00:25:09,599
I want to talk to Dervish Efendi.

196
00:25:10,080 --> 00:25:13,599
Orhan Bey... He knows him.

197
00:25:14,080 --> 00:25:18,119
Yunus Emre?

198
00:25:25,560 --> 00:25:27,599
Demirbogan, Baysungur, hurry.

199
00:25:27,600 --> 00:25:32,599
The cart will come from this
way. They won't go anywhere.

200
00:25:36,560 --> 00:25:42,119
Don't worry, my Shahzade.
We will make them see hell.

201
00:25:48,080 --> 00:25:53,119
-Come... Come.
-Come on.

202
00:26:12,560 --> 00:26:16,119
-Oghuz Alp.
-My Shahzade. -Together.

203
00:26:18,080 --> 00:26:22,599
Come on.

204
00:26:28,080 --> 00:26:31,119
Nokers! Nokers!

205
00:26:35,560 --> 00:26:41,119
Come on! O Allah!

206
00:27:38,080 --> 00:27:43,119
All nokers will be killed! Kill everyone,
except for the commander!

207
00:27:43,120 --> 00:27:46,119
Insolent Turk who attacked
Great Olcaytu Khan's caravan...

208
00:27:46,120 --> 00:27:50,119
...you will beg me not to kill you!

209
00:28:05,560 --> 00:28:10,119
From now on, you will think
twice before you threaten a Turk.

210
00:28:13,560 --> 00:28:17,119
And let this be a lesson for you.

211
00:28:26,080 --> 00:28:30,599
Good... We have e gold. Baysungur.

212
00:28:30,600 --> 00:28:34,119
Tie this dog, apparently, he has things to tell us.

213
00:28:34,120 --> 00:28:37,119
You cannot make me speak!

214
00:28:38,080 --> 00:28:42,119
I can strangle you here, shut up.

215
00:28:42,560 --> 00:28:45,599
Come on! Take him!

216
00:28:45,600 --> 00:28:48,119
Stand up! Come here!

217
00:29:09,080 --> 00:29:11,599
Welcome, my Bey...

218
00:29:12,080 --> 00:29:14,599
Malhun...

219
00:29:17,080 --> 00:29:20,119
What happened?
What is the situation?

220
00:29:24,080 --> 00:29:26,599
Ayca Hatun..

221
00:29:27,080 --> 00:29:30,599
...was poisoned. -What?

222
00:29:32,080 --> 00:29:34,599
Osman Bey?

223
00:29:37,080 --> 00:29:40,119
Who did this?

224
00:29:40,120 --> 00:29:45,599
We put Holofira and Olivia in the dungeon,
my Bey. We have doubts about them.

225
00:29:47,080 --> 00:29:50,599
Osman Bey...

226
00:29:56,560 --> 00:30:00,119
I thought putting them in the
dungeon was the best way to...

227
00:30:00,120 --> 00:30:02,599
...calm Gunduz Bey and Elcim Hatun down.

228
00:30:05,560 --> 00:30:09,599
You thought well. You
thought well. But... how is she?

229
00:30:09,600 --> 00:30:14,599
Alaeddin is trying... He said he can
find the cure if he can find the poison.

230
00:30:14,600 --> 00:30:17,599
What if he can't find it?

231
00:30:31,080 --> 00:30:33,599
Did Holofira..

232
00:30:34,080 --> 00:30:36,119
...say something?

233
00:30:36,120 --> 00:30:39,599
She does not speak, my Bey. She
didn't answer to any of our questions.

234
00:30:43,560 --> 00:30:46,599
What do you think?

235
00:30:46,600 --> 00:30:49,119
Her test is not easy.

236
00:30:49,120 --> 00:30:55,599
Even if I say the devil tricked her...
I don't think Holofira would do this.

237
00:30:58,560 --> 00:31:01,119
-Father..
-My daughter...

238
00:31:01,120 --> 00:31:04,599
-My daughter...
-Father..

239
00:31:05,560 --> 00:31:08,599
I don't know who to be worried about.

240
00:31:09,080 --> 00:31:12,119
My brother... The situation my brother is in...

241
00:31:12,560 --> 00:31:14,599
What kind of test is this?

242
00:31:14,600 --> 00:31:19,119
-Whom will he be upset for, huh?
-Don't worry, my daughter.

243
00:31:19,120 --> 00:31:22,599
With Allah's consent, the one
who did this will be punished.

244
00:31:23,080 --> 00:31:26,119
But we will pray for my Ayca daughter now.

245
00:31:26,120 --> 00:31:30,599
Justice will handle the rest.

246
00:31:37,080 --> 00:31:41,119
If we don't handle this matter justly...

247
00:31:41,560 --> 00:31:46,119
...the unification of the Kayi
tribes will remain a dream for us.

248
00:31:46,560 --> 00:31:51,599
The one who wanted this to
happen must have planned this.

249
00:31:51,600 --> 00:31:55,599
We know who did it. Imren Tegin.

250
00:31:55,600 --> 00:32:00,119
He was saying that he would chase us
like a nightmare unless he took the trusts.

251
00:32:01,560 --> 00:32:05,599
This is only the beginning.
This is only the beginning.

252
00:32:05,600 --> 00:32:08,119
Let's see what else is going to happen.

253
00:32:08,560 --> 00:32:13,119
We will solve this matter with justice.
And we will be careful if Allah permits.

254
00:32:13,120 --> 00:32:16,599
We won't let it happen again.

255
00:32:16,600 --> 00:32:19,599
Right... right. Come on.

256
00:32:26,080 --> 00:32:29,599
My daughter... -Father!
-My daughter...

257
00:32:29,600 --> 00:32:33,119
-How is Ayca?
-I told Orhan Bey.

258
00:32:33,560 --> 00:32:36,599
That girl would hurt us.

259
00:32:37,080 --> 00:32:40,599
I told him that blood would
be shed. He didn't listen, father.

260
00:32:41,080 --> 00:32:44,599
We won't find peace until the one
who did this to my aunt is punished.

261
00:32:44,600 --> 00:32:48,599
She will be punished, my daughter. Be patient.

262
00:32:49,080 --> 00:32:54,599
Don't get up in anger and sit down
with a loss. I trust Osman Bey's justice.

263
00:32:55,560 --> 00:32:59,119
This marriage will put us in trouble.

264
00:32:59,560 --> 00:33:03,119
That Hatun cast a spell on Orhan Bey.

265
00:33:04,080 --> 00:33:07,599
Father... father, let's give up.

266
00:33:07,600 --> 00:33:10,119
Enough, Elcim

267
00:33:10,120 --> 00:33:16,599
I don't care about what Orhan thinks, I
care about what Osman Bey is going to do!

268
00:33:17,560 --> 00:33:21,119
He will surely punish the one who tried to kill...

269
00:33:21,120 --> 00:33:23,599
...my daughter and poisoned my daughter-in-law.

270
00:33:31,080 --> 00:33:35,119
Osman has learned that he is not
only fighting against Byzantium...

271
00:33:35,120 --> 00:33:38,119
...but also against the Papacy and European states.

272
00:33:38,120 --> 00:33:41,599
He will make a move. Be careful.

273
00:33:41,600 --> 00:33:44,119
I don't understand how Osman learned this.

274
00:33:44,120 --> 00:33:48,599
No one knew this except for that loose-tongued
Mongol dog who brought the trusts.

275
00:33:48,600 --> 00:33:50,599
He must've told him.

276
00:33:50,600 --> 00:33:55,119
What are we going to do? Osman
will make a move to defeat you.

277
00:33:55,120 --> 00:33:59,119
He might. I will show him that it is impossible.

278
00:33:59,120 --> 00:34:02,119
He won't be able to resist.

279
00:34:03,080 --> 00:34:07,119
Imren Tegin... The Papacy, Latin,
and Frankish ambassadors have arrived.

280
00:34:07,120 --> 00:34:11,119
They are waiting at the inn near
Harmanustu because of the siege.

281
00:34:11,120 --> 00:34:14,119
Good... Right on time.

282
00:34:14,120 --> 00:34:16,599
Bring them in through the secret passages.

283
00:34:17,080 --> 00:34:20,119
You will burn in the hell of Crusaders, Osman.

284
00:34:20,560 --> 00:34:25,119
Then I will establish my state
and turn that hell into my heaven.

285
00:34:47,560 --> 00:34:50,119
Now I'm asking you nicely, commander.

286
00:34:51,080 --> 00:34:54,599
You will take the gold to
Imren Tegin, we know that.

287
00:34:54,600 --> 00:34:57,599
But Atranos is under our siege.

288
00:34:57,600 --> 00:35:01,599
You can't take it * there. Now tell me,

289
00:35:01,600 --> 00:35:04,599
Where are you going to meet with Imren Tegin?

290
00:35:04,600 --> 00:35:08,119
You haven't experienced
the Olcayto Khan’s wrath yet

291
00:35:08,560 --> 00:35:13,599
will herd you all like sheep, will here

292
00:35:13,600 --> 00:35:17,119
You will herd us like a sheep, is that so?

293
00:35:26,080 --> 00:35:29,599
You talk just like Tacettin Noyan, commander.

294
00:35:30,080 --> 00:35:34,119
This is how you talk, this kind
of talking will take you to death.

295
00:35:34,560 --> 00:35:38,599
I’m asking you for the last time,
where are you going to meet with

296
00:35:39,080 --> 00:35:42,599
Imren's men, and when?

297
00:35:42,600 --> 00:35:49,119
Do not resist, commander. Or I'll tie the
rope around your neck, not your hands.

298
00:35:56,080 --> 00:35:59,119
Tell me, when and where?

299
00:35:59,120 --> 00:36:02,599
Stop, stop!

300
00:36:04,080 --> 00:36:08,599
That's it.

301
00:36:11,560 --> 00:36:15,599
Now, talkCome on.

302
00:36:17,560 --> 00:36:24,119
Imren Tegin's men will take the
gold from us in Karadere area.

303
00:36:32,080 --> 00:36:36,119
How do I know that you're
telling the truth, commander?

304
00:36:36,560 --> 00:36:40,119
It is written in the compass.

305
00:36:56,560 --> 00:37:00,599
He's telling the truth. Untie him.

306
00:37:28,560 --> 00:37:33,599
This is for our Muslim brothers you murdered.

307
00:37:33,599 --> 00:37:34,599
The...

308
00:37:38,080 --> 00:37:40,599
...Righteous!

309
00:37:48,560 --> 00:37:53,599
Ignobles!

310
00:37:59,560 --> 00:38:02,119
My Shahzade.

311
00:38:03,080 --> 00:38:07,599
Then we need to go back to Yenisehir.

312
00:38:10,080 --> 00:38:14,119
But I see that you don't want to return.

313
00:38:15,080 --> 00:38:19,599
How can I, Baysungur? My palace

314
00:38:20,080 --> 00:38:25,599
is now my hell. Elcim Hatun blames Holofira.

315
00:38:25,600 --> 00:38:31,119
But Holofira cannot even hurt an ant.

316
00:38:31,120 --> 00:38:35,119
The truth is like a sun, my Shahzade.

317
00:38:35,120 --> 00:38:38,599
-It does not hide.
-Right.

318
00:38:39,560 --> 00:38:44,119
I need to find a way to acquit Holofira.

319
00:38:45,080 --> 00:38:50,119
But if I can't, then...

320
00:38:53,080 --> 00:38:57,119
If Holofira is innocent,

321
00:38:57,120 --> 00:39:00,599
it will be revealed eventually, my Shahzade,

322
00:39:01,080 --> 00:39:07,119
but if she's guilty, what
Osman Bey will do is clear.

323
00:39:10,560 --> 00:39:13,599
That's what I'm afraid of, Baysungur.

324
00:39:15,080 --> 00:39:19,119
Allah is great. Come on.

325
00:39:24,560 --> 00:39:30,599
I united Mongols and Papacy.
I gave Quds to the Crusaders.

326
00:39:31,080 --> 00:39:34,119
The Crusaders army...

327
00:39:34,120 --> 00:39:36,599
...is coming from Franks, Latins and Papacy.

328
00:39:36,600 --> 00:39:41,119
They will storm into these lands
with the ships of Venetians.

329
00:39:41,120 --> 00:39:43,599
They will unite with Byzantium.

330
00:39:43,600 --> 00:39:48,599
Turks are holding the border lines.
Where are we going to come out?

331
00:39:56,670 --> 00:39:59,119
From Sudibi.

332
00:40:00,080 --> 00:40:04,599
Turks will want to unite against
this army, they will be equipped.

333
00:40:05,080 --> 00:40:07,599
They will probably stand behind Kayis,

334
00:40:07,600 --> 00:40:10,599
...the most resilient among them.

335
00:40:10,600 --> 00:40:13,119
Which is Osman.

336
00:40:16,560 --> 00:40:20,599
Osman knows that this army will crush his people

337
00:40:21,080 --> 00:40:23,119
and loot them.

338
00:40:23,120 --> 00:40:27,599
He will do whatever it takes
for us to cross Crusaders' lands.

339
00:40:27,600 --> 00:40:31,119
His lands will make him time for defense.

340
00:40:31,120 --> 00:40:34,599
It will waste our time, Imren Tegin.

341
00:40:34,600 --> 00:40:38,119
But I won't let that happen.
I'll go with the pioneer troops

342
00:40:38,120 --> 00:40:42,599
I'll destroy him before he sets his defense line.

343
00:40:43,080 --> 00:40:49,599
In the name of Jesus Christ, Osman will
be destroyed just like the Seljuk Sultans.

344
00:40:51,080 --> 00:40:55,119
We will set up headquarters
in Konya after Yenisehir.

345
00:40:55,560 --> 00:40:59,119
In the meantime, the Crusader army that
will set out after the news of Osman's death

346
00:40:59,120 --> 00:41:01,599
will have landed in Sudibi coast.

347
00:41:02,080 --> 00:41:06,119
They will kill the Turks and come to Konya

348
00:41:06,120 --> 00:41:11,119
then we'll go together

349
00:41:12,560 --> 00:41:14,599
and we will take Quds.

350
00:41:14,600 --> 00:41:17,599
And I will the only ruler of these lands.

351
00:41:17,600 --> 00:41:21,119
Let's eat. You've come a long way.

352
00:41:21,120 --> 00:41:24,599
You must be starving.

353
00:41:37,780 --> 00:41:42,119
Of course we will not let Crusaders
cross our path, it's not a public inn.

354
00:41:42,120 --> 00:41:46,119
No. Never. We will never let that happen.

355
00:41:46,720 --> 00:41:50,599
Brave men will not move as a single army.

356
00:41:51,080 --> 00:41:55,119
They will be under Beys' commands. And from now on

357
00:41:55,120 --> 00:41:58,599
alps will only use hit and run tactics.

358
00:42:01,560 --> 00:42:06,119
My Bey, I think we need to send scout units...

359
00:42:06,560 --> 00:42:11,119
...in case Crusaders come via ship.

360
00:42:11,560 --> 00:42:15,119
My Bey, it's not so hard to understand,

361
00:42:15,120 --> 00:42:20,599
mren Tegin wants to destroy us using the Crusaders.

362
00:42:20,600 --> 00:42:23,599
The Crusader army is like a swarm of locusts.

363
00:42:23,600 --> 00:42:27,119
They want to crush us and then go to Konya.

364
00:42:29,080 --> 00:42:34,599
We know what they did to their
fellow believers in Constantinople.

365
00:42:34,600 --> 00:42:37,599
Who knows what will they do to us?

366
00:42:38,080 --> 00:42:42,599
Imren Tegin does not only want our lands.

367
00:42:43,080 --> 00:42:49,119
He also wants all the lands from the Frontier
Marketplace to the center of Kutahya.

368
00:42:51,560 --> 00:42:55,599
So, tell me, Mehmed Bey.

369
00:42:56,080 --> 00:42:58,599
What is needed to stop the Crusaders?

370
00:42:59,080 --> 00:43:02,599
A lot of men and swords.

371
00:43:02,600 --> 00:43:08,599
Let me tell you what you want
to hear, being united is needed.

372
00:43:08,600 --> 00:43:11,119
Good, good.

373
00:43:11,120 --> 00:43:14,599
You know us very well.

374
00:43:16,560 --> 00:43:20,119
Know that I want you and your father behind me.

375
00:43:20,120 --> 00:43:24,599
My father Yakup Bey is fighting in
the south. I can't ask soldiers from him.

376
00:43:25,080 --> 00:43:28,847
If it is about being
united, I'll inform my father...

377
00:43:28,859 --> 00:43:32,119
...and I'll support you
with the soldiers here.

378
00:43:33,080 --> 00:43:36,119
Thank you.

379
00:43:38,560 --> 00:43:43,119
Konur. Send messengers to Karesi, Candar,
Hamidoglus, Esrefoglus, all of them.

380
00:43:46,080 --> 00:43:49,599
I want them all to support me in the battle.

381
00:43:50,080 --> 00:43:52,599
Yes, my Bey.

382
00:43:53,080 --> 00:43:57,119
There's no need to inform Candaroglus.

383
00:43:57,560 --> 00:44:03,119
He already went to Kutahya,
his men must be fighting now.

384
00:44:04,560 --> 00:44:07,599
What's he doing in Kutahya?

385
00:44:08,080 --> 00:44:14,119
You ask for union, but we have
the same purpose, Alaeddin Bey.

386
00:44:15,080 --> 00:44:19,599
The brother of Suleyman Bey, the Candaroglu Bey

387
00:44:19,600 --> 00:44:23,119
and my sister Gonca Hatun will get married.

388
00:44:27,560 --> 00:44:31,599
Candaroglu and I are practically in-laws.

389
00:44:39,560 --> 00:44:41,109
Very well.

390
00:44:44,080 --> 00:44:47,599
-I hope it works out well.
-Father.

391
00:44:58,080 --> 00:45:02,119
This is needed for unity.

392
00:45:03,080 --> 00:45:09,599
No one should stand against this unity.
Or they would pay the price heavily.

393
00:45:21,080 --> 00:45:27,119
If there is nothing else to
be said, this council is over.

394
00:45:53,080 --> 00:45:56,599
My Shahzade, Holofira Hatun..

395
00:45:56,600 --> 00:46:00,119
..does not want to see you.

396
00:46:06,560 --> 00:46:12,599
Holofira, so you do not want to talk to me.

397
00:46:14,560 --> 00:46:19,599
Everyone blames you. However, L..

398
00:46:20,560 --> 00:46:24,599
..I believe you, Lord's daughter.

399
00:46:26,080 --> 00:46:28,599
You did not do this.

400
00:46:29,080 --> 00:46:33,599
You did not poison her, I know.

401
00:46:34,560 --> 00:46:39,599
And I will prove that to everyone.

402
00:46:52,080 --> 00:46:57,599
How can father do this without
asking me about this first!

403
00:46:58,080 --> 00:47:04,119
What will he ask about, Gonca? My
father and mother wants it, so will you.

404
00:47:04,120 --> 00:47:07,599
am the one getting married,
not my mother or father!

405
00:47:07,600 --> 00:47:10,599
You will do this for our tribe.

406
00:47:12,560 --> 00:47:18,599
If you still think about Alaeddin,
you will not see him again.

407
00:47:19,080 --> 00:47:23,119
You know what will happen if
you do. You are engaged now!

408
00:47:23,560 --> 00:47:26,599
Are we allowed, Gonca Hatun?

409
00:47:26,600 --> 00:47:29,119
Come in, Fatma.

410
00:47:31,080 --> 00:47:38,599
Mother Bala calls you. They
need your help for Ayca Hatun.

411
00:47:39,080 --> 00:47:44,119
-Go, Gonca.
-Alright, I will.

412
00:47:57,560 --> 00:48:00,119
Alaeddin Bey.

413
00:48:05,080 --> 00:48:08,119
-If you see my brother..
-Forget about your brother, Gonca!

414
00:48:08,120 --> 00:48:13,599
Where did this marriage come
from? I try to keep calm after hearing it.

415
00:48:14,080 --> 00:48:18,599
Did you know of it?
-No, I did not.

416
00:48:19,560 --> 00:48:23,119
I am confused, Alaeddin.

417
00:48:23,120 --> 00:48:25,599
My father..

418
00:48:26,080 --> 00:48:29,119
How can my father do this
to me? I do not understand.

419
00:48:29,120 --> 00:48:33,599
There is nothing to be confused.
It is apparent what to be done.

420
00:48:33,600 --> 00:48:36,119
What is it?

421
00:48:37,560 --> 00:48:40,599
We will get married.

422
00:48:45,080 --> 00:48:49,119
Do you hear what you are saying?

423
00:48:50,080 --> 00:48:54,599
Do you know what this means,
Alaeddin? This means war..

424
00:48:56,080 --> 00:48:59,599
-..of Kayi and Germiyanids but also Candaroglu!
-If it means war..

425
00:49:00,080 --> 00:49:02,599
..then I will fight, Gonca.

426
00:49:03,080 --> 00:49:07,119
However, I will not let anyone have you.

427
00:49:07,560 --> 00:49:11,599
-I will not.
-Alaeddin.

428
00:49:12,560 --> 00:49:15,599
Your life is at the stake at the end of this.

429
00:49:15,600 --> 00:49:20,119
I can not do this to you. I
can not throw you into the fire.

430
00:49:20,120 --> 00:49:26,119
My Gonca. If you go, I will already fall in it.

431
00:49:27,560 --> 00:49:33,119
Do not do this. Let us go to
my father, he will be on our side.

432
00:49:39,080 --> 00:49:43,119
No.

433
00:49:43,560 --> 00:49:48,599
Ask everything from me, even my life.

434
00:49:49,080 --> 00:49:54,119
However, I can not throw you
into this fire Scholar, please.

435
00:49:56,560 --> 00:50:00,119
You are calling me Scholar.

436
00:50:01,080 --> 00:50:05,599
Is this how you would free
my name, Trickster Hatun?

437
00:50:07,560 --> 00:50:10,119
Don't.

438
00:50:12,560 --> 00:50:15,119
Say yes, and let this torture end.

439
00:50:15,120 --> 00:50:19,119
If she says yes, I will be in trouble.
If she does not, I will still be in trouble.

440
00:50:19,120 --> 00:50:21,599
Either way, I get into trouble.

441
00:50:23,080 --> 00:50:26,119
O, Yakup Bey.

442
00:50:26,560 --> 00:50:29,119
-Kanyumaz, we will head to Frontier Marketplace.
-My Shahzade?

443
00:50:30,080 --> 00:50:34,119
-You go first with the goods tomorrow.
-As you command, my Shahzade.

444
00:50:37,560 --> 00:50:40,599
No, they will get caught.

445
00:50:40,600 --> 00:50:43,599
-Gonca.
-Mehmed will kill Gonca.

446
00:50:43,600 --> 00:50:46,119
What will I do?

447
00:50:49,560 --> 00:50:53,119
Get yourself into trouble Ghazi.

448
00:50:53,120 --> 00:50:56,599
-All this for you, Gonca Hatun.

449
00:50:56,600 --> 00:50:59,119
Mehmed Bey!

450
00:50:59,120 --> 00:51:02,119
Draw youf sword and face me!

451
00:51:02,120 --> 00:51:04,599
I am very mad at you!

452
00:51:04,600 --> 00:51:09,119
So you want training, Ghazi Alp.

453
00:51:10,080 --> 00:51:15,119
Come on theni

454
00:51:15,560 --> 00:51:19,689
Valiant Ghazi!

455
00:51:20,600 --> 00:51:24,119
You little valiant!
So you will defeat me, huh?

456
00:51:24,560 --> 00:51:29,599
When am I going to
go to battle with you?

457
00:51:30,080 --> 00:51:35,119
Do not ask this from me, Alaeddin.

458
00:51:42,080 --> 00:51:45,119
Think about it until tomorrow morning, Gonca.

459
00:51:48,080 --> 00:51:50,599
Think about it well.

460
00:52:00,080 --> 00:52:03,599
I can not breathe without you, Hatun.

461
00:52:04,080 --> 00:52:09,599
Holofira does not say a word, my
Bey. She only wants to see Yunus Emre.

462
00:52:10,560 --> 00:52:14,119
Do not worry.

463
00:52:14,560 --> 00:52:17,599
Yunus Emre will make her talk, I hope.

464
00:52:18,560 --> 00:52:21,119
And we will find who did this.

465
00:52:21,120 --> 00:52:24,119
I hope so, my Bey.

466
00:52:24,560 --> 00:52:30,119
-Are we allowed, Osman Bey?
-Come in, Gunduz Bey.

467
00:52:35,080 --> 00:52:39,119
Gunduz Bey, tell me. How is Ayca Hatun?

468
00:52:42,080 --> 00:52:46,599
My bride, fights for her life in front of my eyes.

469
00:52:48,080 --> 00:52:51,119
While she is in this state..

470
00:52:51,120 --> 00:52:54,599
..how is the person who did this to her doing?

471
00:52:55,080 --> 00:52:59,599
We are investigating Gunduz Bey. We
will find who is responsible, if Allah permits.

472
00:53:01,080 --> 00:53:05,599
Isn't the person who did
this, is your son's lover..

473
00:53:05,600 --> 00:53:09,599
..Holofira, Malhun Hatun?

474
00:53:14,080 --> 00:53:18,119
-Or, are you afraid of someone?
-Hold it.

475
00:53:18,120 --> 00:53:22,599
Hold it, Gunduz Bey. Who
have we ever been afraid of?

476
00:53:23,560 --> 00:53:28,119
Tell me, who?
We are trying...

477
00:53:28,560 --> 00:53:31,119
...to reveal the truth. To provide justice.

478
00:53:32,560 --> 00:53:36,119
Thnak you.
Osman Bey...

479
00:53:36,120 --> 00:53:39,119
...I trust your justice.

480
00:53:39,120 --> 00:53:44,599
My Beys, my tribe are waiting for your word.

481
00:53:47,080 --> 00:53:51,599
However, if the opposite happens..

482
00:53:52,080 --> 00:53:58,119
..and balance is not provided..

483
00:54:00,560 --> 00:54:04,599
So, Gunduz Bey?

484
00:54:05,080 --> 00:54:09,119
-Complete your sentence.
-Then..

485
00:54:09,560 --> 00:54:13,599
..I can not provide unity.

486
00:54:16,080 --> 00:54:20,599
If I lose respect from my tribe, my beys..

487
00:54:20,600 --> 00:54:23,599
..we will be gone, Osman Bey.

488
00:54:24,560 --> 00:54:28,119
Osman Bey's justice does not
make mistakes, Gunduz Bey.

489
00:54:28,120 --> 00:54:30,599
Do not worry.

490
00:54:31,080 --> 00:54:35,599
There will be a court
tomorrow. Holofira will be judged.

491
00:54:36,080 --> 00:54:42,119
If she is guilty, she will pay the price.

492
00:54:42,120 --> 00:54:44,599
Don't you worry.

493
00:54:44,600 --> 00:54:48,119
-Thank you.
-Malhun....

494
00:54:49,080 --> 00:54:53,599
...hold her until tomorrow.
-As you command, my Bey.

495
00:54:57,080 --> 00:55:00,599
Come on girls. You got the olives and bread?

496
00:55:00,600 --> 00:55:04,599
Take the breads as well.

497
00:55:04,600 --> 00:55:07,599
Come on ladies.

498
00:55:08,560 --> 00:55:11,599
Come on then.

499
00:55:21,560 --> 00:55:27,119
Mubarak Ramazan has arrived!

500
00:55:31,560 --> 00:55:36,119
Your time has arrived as well.

501
00:55:43,080 --> 00:55:47,119
I prayed so much during your absence, Cerkutay.

502
00:55:47,120 --> 00:55:51,599
Thanks to Allah, we will
spend this Ramadan together.

503
00:55:57,560 --> 00:56:03,119
We expelled dark times! Now we will be together!

504
00:56:06,560 --> 00:56:10,119
My Ulgen, just tell me to smile...

505
00:56:10,120 --> 00:56:13,599
...and our joy will be forever!

506
00:56:16,560 --> 00:56:20,119
-Don't make me feel ashamed.
-Feel ashamed, girl.

507
00:56:25,080 --> 00:56:28,599
Well... The drum has shown up, huh?

508
00:56:30,080 --> 00:56:33,119
Alps didn't give me that for long.

509
00:56:33,120 --> 00:56:37,599
They told me to grow up first.
I've grown up now. Give it to me.

510
00:56:37,600 --> 00:56:41,119
Well, Ghazi... Your father...

511
00:56:41,120 --> 00:56:44,119
...is the inventor of this drum.

512
00:56:45,560 --> 00:56:48,599
It isn’t an easy job.

513
00:56:48,600 --> 00:56:50,599
I never demand the easy.

514
00:56:50,600 --> 00:56:53,599
-Wow.
-Look at him.

515
00:56:55,080 --> 00:56:57,599
Just give it to him.
Let's see if he can.

516
00:56:57,600 --> 00:57:01,119
Yes, Cerkutay Bey. I've seen him.

517
00:57:01,560 --> 00:57:05,119
Ghazi has been waiting for
this moment for a long time.

518
00:57:09,560 --> 00:57:12,599
You think he can do it?

519
00:57:17,560 --> 00:57:20,119
Come on then.

520
00:57:25,080 --> 00:57:27,599
Come here.

521
00:57:31,080 --> 00:57:35,119
Take this. This one too.

522
00:57:37,560 --> 00:57:40,599
Now hit it!

523
00:57:43,080 --> 00:57:47,119
But only drum sound isn't enough.

524
00:57:48,080 --> 00:57:51,119
We need nice words as well.

525
00:57:51,120 --> 00:57:55,599
Everybody should jump up when they hear the words!

526
00:57:55,600 --> 00:58:00,119
-I know words to say, father.
-Well...

527
00:58:06,080 --> 00:58:09,599
Just watch the party now.

528
00:58:25,560 --> 00:58:28,599
Brother.

529
00:58:29,080 --> 00:58:31,599
Alaaddin.

530
00:58:34,560 --> 00:58:40,119
Brother, Turkmen Bey will get mad
whe I run away with Gonca, right?

531
00:58:41,560 --> 00:58:48,119
Things will be crazy. But if you.
don't, you will be burned, Alaaddin.

532
00:58:49,560 --> 00:58:52,119
I will talk to father first.

533
00:58:52,560 --> 00:58:58,119
But I don't know what to
do if he doesn't back me up.

534
00:59:02,080 --> 00:59:07,119
What happened to us? My grandfather used to say...

535
00:59:07,560 --> 00:59:11,119
"Love test would be tough."

536
00:59:11,560 --> 00:59:16,119
As the love grows bigger, the tests gets harder.

537
00:59:16,560 --> 00:59:22,119
I was feeling sorry for myself but
you fell into the same fire with me.

538
00:59:23,560 --> 00:59:27,119
I don't know what we should do.

539
00:59:29,080 --> 00:59:31,599
The state on one side.

540
00:59:32,560 --> 00:59:37,119
And the woman I love on the other.
What's worse, she's in the dungeon.

541
00:59:38,080 --> 00:59:42,119
With a broken and upset heart.

542
00:59:43,560 --> 00:59:46,599
Her body...

543
00:59:47,560 --> 00:59:51,119
...and my heart are in the dungeon.

544
00:59:52,080 --> 00:59:57,599
Me? What should I do? She's
on the other end of this corridor.

545
00:59:58,560 --> 01:00:02,599
If I went out in the corridor,
I could hear her breathing.

546
01:00:04,560 --> 01:00:07,119
But I can't reach her.

547
01:00:09,080 --> 01:00:12,119
I can't get close to her, brother.

548
01:00:14,560 --> 01:00:20,119
Now there is also this marriage issue.

549
01:00:22,080 --> 01:00:26,119
Brother, you should talk to father first.

550
01:00:26,120 --> 01:00:30,119
If you can't find a way out, then...

551
01:00:32,560 --> 01:00:37,599
Drumstick is short! Shahzade is tall...

552
01:00:37,600 --> 01:00:40,119
...with a short mind.

553
01:00:41,080 --> 01:00:46,119
I won't let you marry Gonca now get up for sahur!

554
01:00:50,080 --> 01:00:53,119
Run away with her. I support you.

555
01:00:53,560 --> 01:00:56,599
Even Ghazi alps tells you to run away with her.

556
01:00:58,560 --> 01:01:02,119
Alaaddin, my brother...

557
01:01:02,560 --> 01:01:07,119
Whatever you do, I will back you up.

558
01:01:08,560 --> 01:01:14,599
Brother, I wouldn't hesitate for a moment
if I were Shepherd Osman's son but...

559
01:01:16,080 --> 01:01:18,599
We are Bey Osman's son,

560
01:01:18,600 --> 01:01:24,599
Yes. Yes. Bey Osman is
awaiting us for the sahur. Let's go.

561
01:01:42,560 --> 01:01:45,119
Ramadan has arrived in our city!

562
01:01:45,120 --> 01:01:48,599
And Rosebuds blossomed in our house!

563
01:01:49,560 --> 01:01:55,599
Wake up for sahur!
Let the blessing rain over us!

564
01:02:00,560 --> 01:02:06,119
Ramadan is Sultan of eleven months!
I have Gonca Sultan in my heart.

565
01:02:06,120 --> 01:02:09,599
O Gonca, marry Ghazi Alp

566
01:02:09,600 --> 01:02:13,119
So we can have double bairams in Ramadan!

567
01:02:22,080 --> 01:02:25,119
Ghazi...

568
01:02:26,560 --> 01:02:29,119
Come here, Ghazi.

569
01:02:29,120 --> 01:02:32,599
-Keep playing it. Not everybody woke up.
-Tall Shahzade...

570
01:02:32,600 --> 01:02:35,599
...has no authority on me!

571
01:02:57,560 --> 01:03:02,119
I’m highly grateful to Allah who
let us reach this Ramadan Month.

572
01:03:02,120 --> 01:03:06,599
If Allah permits, we will spend
this Ramadan in our tribe.

573
01:03:06,600 --> 01:03:08,119
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits, my Bey.

574
01:03:08,120 --> 01:03:11,599
Actually, I was thinking...

575
01:03:12,080 --> 01:03:17,119
-We should hold the wedding there.
-It's appropriate.

576
01:03:21,080 --> 01:03:23,599
Well...

577
01:03:24,080 --> 01:03:29,599
You all know about the trouble over us.
But with this Ramadan Month, Allah...

578
01:03:29,600 --> 01:03:33,599
...will give us strength to repel the heathens.

579
01:03:33,600 --> 01:03:35,119
-Amen.
-Amen.

580
01:03:35,120 --> 01:03:41,119
And we're making plans to keep
our people and Muslims united.

581
01:03:42,560 --> 01:03:47,599
We will never let heathens get into our lands.

582
01:03:47,600 --> 01:03:49,999
But remember this.

583
01:03:50,120 --> 01:03:55,119
We need to provide unity for this first.

584
01:04:03,560 --> 01:04:08,599
-Am I right, Gunduz Bey?
-Of course you are, Osman Bey.

585
01:04:13,080 --> 01:04:16,119
Tell me, Mehmed Bey.

586
01:04:16,560 --> 01:04:19,599
While heathens sharpen their teeth for us,

587
01:04:20,080 --> 01:04:23,119
...we should stand stronger together.

588
01:04:23,560 --> 01:04:28,599
When they attempt to bite us,
their teeth will get broken first.

589
01:04:29,560 --> 01:04:34,119
Alright, Osman Bey.
We will always do our part.

590
01:04:36,560 --> 01:04:40,119
Thank you, thank you.
Konur.

591
01:04:40,120 --> 01:04:44,599
Did the alps in the castle of Atronos get paid?

592
01:04:44,600 --> 01:04:47,599
-We prepared all in the morning, my Bey.
-Thank you, thank you.

593
01:04:48,080 --> 01:04:52,119
We also handed out the food to
Yenisehir people for Ramadan, my Bey.

594
01:04:52,560 --> 01:04:56,119
And we made up all the
shortages of Gunduz Bey's people.

595
01:04:56,120 --> 01:04:58,599
Thank you, live long.
Thank you.

596
01:04:58,600 --> 01:05:04,000
"He who sleeps with a full stomach while his
neighbor is hungry is not a true believer"

597
01:05:04,000 --> 01:05:05,540
...our Prophet said.

598
01:05:06,560 --> 01:05:10,599
They are not our neighbors,
but members of my house.

599
01:05:10,600 --> 01:05:17,119
Now we’re even responsible for the food in
the throat of the bird flying over the mountain.

600
01:05:17,560 --> 01:05:24,119
If we find a piece of bread, we should share it.

601
01:05:24,560 --> 01:05:30,119
Now that our people have soup today...

602
01:05:30,560 --> 01:05:35,119
....let's get started then. In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

603
01:05:35,120 --> 01:05:38,599
May our sahur be mubarak.

604
01:05:39,700 --> 01:05:41,819
Let's start, let's eat.

605
01:05:42,019 --> 01:05:44,619
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

606
01:05:58,080 --> 01:06:01,599
Father, playing the drum made me hungry.

607
01:06:02,080 --> 01:06:05,119
Eat, my boy.

608
01:06:09,080 --> 01:06:12,119
Here, Osman.

609
01:06:45,560 --> 01:06:51,599
Imren Tegin. I will bury you
alive in the castle of Atronos...

610
01:06:52,080 --> 01:06:54,599
...where you are hiding.

611
01:06:56,080 --> 01:06:59,599
Allah is with us.
Allah is with us.

612
01:07:00,080 --> 01:07:03,119
You will see, Imren Tegin.

613
01:07:04,080 --> 01:07:09,599
-Do I have permission, my Bey?
-Come in.

614
01:07:12,080 --> 01:07:14,599
My Bey, you wanted to see us?

615
01:07:15,080 --> 01:07:19,119
Welcome. Welcome. Here we are.

616
01:07:38,080 --> 01:07:41,599
In the name of Allah,
the merciful, the compassionate.

617
01:07:51,560 --> 01:07:57,599
If this can! heal her, it will be very hard to
save Ayca Hatun from the death dungeon.

618
01:08:46,560 --> 01:08:52,118
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate. Help us, my Allah.

619
01:08:57,560 --> 01:09:03,118
I've found it! Thanks to Allah, I’ve found it!

620
01:09:16,080 --> 01:09:18,118
Baysungur!

621
01:09:18,120 --> 01:09:22,118
-Osman Bey, this is a dangerous move.
-We don't have any other chance, Bala Hatun.

622
01:09:22,560 --> 01:09:26,118
If we fail, everyone in our
lands will become our enemies.

623
01:09:26,120 --> 01:09:28,599
We will risk everything, Malhun Hatun.

624
01:09:29,080 --> 01:09:33,118
We will risk everything.
This is not only for our lands.

625
01:09:33,560 --> 01:09:36,118
This is for the lands of all Turks.

626
01:09:36,560 --> 01:09:43,118
That's how we can protect Yakup
Bey's lands and the well-being of Turks.

627
01:09:43,120 --> 01:09:46,118
Thus, Konur...

628
01:09:46,120 --> 01:09:49,599
You will arrest Germiyan Alps
without shedding their blood.

629
01:09:49,600 --> 01:09:52,118
You will gather them in Kizilca cave.

630
01:09:52,560 --> 01:09:56,119
Yes my Bey.
-What about Mehmet and Gonca?

631
01:09:56,120 --> 01:10:00,599
You will lock them in a room in the
palace. They will not leave the palace.

632
01:10:01,560 --> 01:10:07,119
And we will take the frontiers marketplace.

633
01:10:07,560 --> 01:10:10,599
What about Yakup Bey? What will he say to this?

634
01:10:10,600 --> 01:10:15,599
Hard decisions are made during hard times.
We cannot waste time by telling this to anyone.

635
01:10:16,560 --> 01:10:19,599
-Tell me, is everyone ready for the hearing?
-Yes my Bey.

636
01:10:20,080 --> 01:10:23,119
Okay, okay. If we cannot secure justice...

637
01:10:23,120 --> 01:10:25,599
...today in the hearing...

638
01:10:26,560 --> 01:10:29,119
...it won't be good for Turks' well-being.

639
01:10:30,560 --> 01:10:36,599
If Holofira tried to kill Ayca Hatun...

640
01:10:38,080 --> 01:10:42,599
...she will be punished.
-What if it's not her who did this?

641
01:10:43,080 --> 01:10:45,599
Then we will have to convince Gunduz Bey.

642
01:10:46,080 --> 01:10:49,119
And that will be difficult. But no matter what...

643
01:10:49,120 --> 01:10:53,119
...we will secure the justice.

644
01:10:53,120 --> 01:10:57,119
-Can I come in, my Bey?
-Come in.

645
01:11:03,080 --> 01:11:06,599
My Bey, Alaeddin Bey sent this.

646
01:11:13,080 --> 01:11:16,119
-This is Olivia's ring, my Bey.
-Olivia...

647
01:11:17,080 --> 01:11:21,599
There was poison in it, my Bey. It was used.

648
01:11:22,080 --> 01:11:23,119
Olivia...

649
01:11:23,120 --> 01:11:25,599
-Boran.
-My Bey...

650
01:11:25,600 --> 01:11:28,119
You will present this as evidence in the hearing.

651
01:11:28,120 --> 01:11:30,599
Yes my Bey.

652
01:11:30,600 --> 01:11:34,599
Now we will walk to Atranos.
Then we will set our court.

653
01:11:35,080 --> 01:11:38,119
Now it is time to face Imren.

654
01:11:38,120 --> 01:11:40,599
-Boran. -My Bey.
-Prepare the horses.

655
01:11:40,600 --> 01:11:43,119
-Yes my Bey.
-Justice...

656
01:11:43,560 --> 01:11:49,119
...will be secured in the palace
and in the castle of the infidels.

657
01:11:50,080 --> 01:11:54,599
If we cannot find the poison, my
aunt will die in front of us, father.

658
01:11:54,600 --> 01:12:00,119
Don't give up hope, my daughter.
Alaeddin Bey is going to heal.

659
01:12:00,560 --> 01:12:04,599
Justice will be secured, if Allah permits.

660
01:12:09,080 --> 01:12:12,119
I don't trust the fairness of this hearing, father.

661
01:12:12,120 --> 01:12:15,599
Elcim! Don't you know me, my daughter?

662
01:12:16,080 --> 01:12:19,599
The one who tried to hurt someone
from my family will be punished’

663
01:12:19,600 --> 01:12:23,119
-I will not let them decide otherwise!
-I hope so, father.

664
01:12:23,560 --> 01:12:25,599
I hope it will happen as you say.

665
01:12:25,600 --> 01:12:32,119
-Can I come in, Gunduz Bey?
-Come in, Alaeddin Bey.

666
01:12:35,080 --> 01:12:37,599
Did you find the poison, Alaeddin Bey?

667
01:12:39,080 --> 01:12:42,119
This is my last hope.

668
01:12:43,080 --> 01:12:47,119
-I hope this will heal.
-If Allah permits -Make her drink this.

669
01:12:53,080 --> 01:12:56,119
In the name of Allah, the merciful,
the compassionate.

670
01:12:59,080 --> 01:13:03,119
O Healer, O Healer, O Healer!

671
01:13:31,080 --> 01:13:34,119
Imren Tegin... Osman.

672
01:13:34,120 --> 01:13:38,599
He came to Atranos to talk to you.

673
01:13:38,600 --> 01:13:41,599
He can come. I was waiting for him.

674
01:13:42,080 --> 01:13:44,535
It must've been hard
for him to wait for death...

675
01:13:44,547 --> 01:13:47,119
...in his own land, since he
came to his own Azrael

676
01:13:48,080 --> 01:13:50,119
He trusts the signs he has.

677
01:13:50,120 --> 01:13:53,119
He might bow down and give you back the trusts...

678
01:13:53,120 --> 01:13:56,599
People like Osman do not bow down easily, Daniel.

679
01:13:58,080 --> 01:14:01,119
He will want to bargain for sure.

680
01:14:01,120 --> 01:14:04,599
Let's kill him. Then he and Turks will have seen...

681
01:14:04,600 --> 01:14:09,119
...how we bargain. Then,
they will also bring the trusts.

682
01:14:09,560 --> 01:14:14,119
Torment or death won't make Osman step back.

683
01:14:17,080 --> 01:14:21,119
He will live until I take the things I want, then..

684
01:14:22,560 --> 01:14:25,119
...then Turks...

685
01:14:29,080 --> 01:14:31,599
...and Osman will die.

686
01:14:35,560 --> 01:14:38,119
Let’s go.

687
01:15:25,080 --> 01:15:28,119
Let's see the inside of...

688
01:15:28,560 --> 01:15:31,119
...the Atranos Castle that we besieged.

689
01:15:31,560 --> 01:15:36,119
Look very carefully, it will be your last time.

690
01:15:38,560 --> 01:15:43,119
I can see that your wounds were healed.

691
01:15:45,080 --> 01:15:50,119
Nothing is heavier than what you lost, Imren Tegin.

692
01:15:52,080 --> 01:15:56,119
Your men cannot be beaten
in a quarrel, right, Osman?

693
01:16:00,560 --> 01:16:05,119
If you're here to see my castle, come on.

694
01:16:05,560 --> 01:16:09,119
I'll show you my brave warriors.

695
01:16:10,080 --> 01:16:13,119
Maybe then you will stop
staring at my castle, Osman Bey.

696
01:16:13,560 --> 01:16:16,599
Did the Crusaders stop staring at my lands?

697
01:16:17,080 --> 01:16:19,599
Why would I change my mind about Abranos?

698
01:16:29,080 --> 01:16:31,599
They are not like us.

699
01:16:32,560 --> 01:16:36,599
The bond we have with
horses is destiny's gift for us.

700
01:16:36,600 --> 01:16:41,119
Westerners do not know how
to shoot arrows on a horse.

701
01:16:42,080 --> 01:16:47,599
A few of them could do it but it was
impossible for them to do it as an army.

702
01:16:55,560 --> 01:17:04,119
Until I, Imren Tegin took over. I did this.

703
01:17:04,560 --> 01:17:11,119
Now I want you to see what
kind of army you will fight against.

704
01:17:11,560 --> 01:17:15,119
You will have an army that
fights like you do, Osman Bey.

705
01:17:15,560 --> 01:17:19,119
They will know your every
move and foresee your every trap.

706
01:17:19,560 --> 01:17:22,119
You will see it when the field is set.

707
01:17:22,560 --> 01:17:27,119
Let your men know about our dominance.

708
01:17:27,560 --> 01:17:31,599
They have no chance against
my brave soldiers in the battlefield.

709
01:17:32,080 --> 01:17:36,119
Brave soldiers? Like the alps behind you?

710
01:17:36,120 --> 01:17:38,599
That's right.

711
01:17:38,600 --> 01:17:43,119
Open the field.

712
01:17:44,560 --> 01:17:49,119
Open it and let them see brave soldiers.

713
01:17:56,080 --> 01:18:02,599
So you want to see your men's strength, is that so?

714
01:18:04,080 --> 01:18:11,119
Let's see. We will see whose
dreams are closer to reality.

715
01:18:13,080 --> 01:18:18,119
Turaham Come here.

716
01:18:19,560 --> 01:18:25,119
-Come here.
-Three against one, is that so?

717
01:18:25,560 --> 01:18:29,119
You're as delusional as they say, Osman Bey.

718
01:18:29,560 --> 01:18:32,119
We will see.

719
01:18:37,560 --> 01:18:40,119
We will see. Come on boy.

720
01:18:40,120 --> 01:18:43,599
-The field is yours.
-Here.

721
01:19:06,560 --> 01:19:09,119
Come on, Turahan!

722
01:19:40,080 --> 01:19:43,119
Come on boy!

723
01:22:01,560 --> 01:22:06,599
Praise be to my brave soldier!
Praise be!

724
01:22:10,560 --> 01:22:16,119
My boy, thank you. Thank you.

725
01:22:22,560 --> 01:22:25,119
Imren Tegin, or whatever you are,

726
01:22:25,120 --> 01:22:27,599
Here, you've seen it.

727
01:22:28,080 --> 01:22:32,119
We take our strength from the cause in our hearts.

728
01:22:32,120 --> 01:22:35,119
That's what you're missing.

729
01:22:37,080 --> 01:22:42,599
People behind us only follow
the path of our Creator.

730
01:22:43,080 --> 01:22:46,349
What about yours? Mercenaries.

731
01:22:46,560 --> 01:22:49,119
Looters, leaderless'...

732
01:22:49,120 --> 01:22:52,119
How many more such skilled
soldiers do you have, Osman Bey?

733
01:22:52,560 --> 01:22:57,119
A hundred? A thousand? Ten thousand?

734
01:22:57,120 --> 01:23:00,599
We're talking about the Crusaders.

735
01:23:01,080 --> 01:23:04,599
Neither your religion nor your
cause can save you in this battle.

736
01:23:05,080 --> 01:23:10,599
Okay. I wanted to talk to you about Crusaders.

737
01:23:12,560 --> 01:23:15,599
I thought you've brought my relics.

738
01:23:17,560 --> 01:23:21,119
Not only relics.

739
01:23:52,080 --> 01:23:56,119
-Osman.
-Now we can talk.

740
01:23:56,560 --> 01:24:01,599
Let's get inside.
Let's talk in private..

741
01:24:24,080 --> 01:24:26,119
Imren's men are coming, my Shahzade.

742
01:24:26,120 --> 01:24:31,119
Everyone knows what to do.
Only one of them is precious for us.

743
01:24:31,560 --> 01:24:34,599
We will destroy the rest of them.

744
01:24:55,560 --> 01:24:58,599
Where is the gold that Olcaytu Khan promised?

745
01:24:58,600 --> 01:25:02,119
-Deliver us the gold.
-You won't get what you hoped...

746
01:25:02,120 --> 01:25:04,599
...you will get what you’ve found.

747
01:25:04,600 --> 01:25:09,599
And that is the sharper side of our swords!

748
01:25:37,560 --> 01:25:41,599
How dare you threaten Turks?

749
01:25:46,560 --> 01:25:51,599
Allah is the Greatest!

750
01:26:04,080 --> 01:26:06,599
Run away, dastard.

751
01:26:07,080 --> 01:26:10,119
We will eventually catch you.

752
01:26:11,560 --> 01:26:14,119
Demirboga,

753
01:26:14,560 --> 01:26:16,119
Follow that dog.

754
01:26:16,120 --> 01:26:19,119
We will learn the hidden
passages in the castle from him.

755
01:26:19,120 --> 01:26:21,599
Yes, my Shahzade.

756
01:26:22,560 --> 01:26:26,119
Now we will hunt you down, Imren Tegin. Alps!

757
01:26:26,560 --> 01:26:30,599
Konur Bey is waiting for you.
Take the gold to them, come on.

758
01:26:30,600 --> 01:26:34,599
Yes, my Shahzade.
Yes, my Shahzade.

759
01:26:58,080 --> 01:27:01,119
And now you're taking my gold, is that so?

760
01:27:01,560 --> 01:27:05,119
You're doing your best to
get yourself killed, Osman.

761
01:27:05,560 --> 01:27:09,599
-And you’re standing against me.
-You're the one who brings the trouble.

762
01:27:10,080 --> 01:27:13,119
I stand in front of people.

763
01:27:13,120 --> 01:27:18,119
I’m the first to get in trouble.
Dying is nothing to me.

764
01:27:18,560 --> 01:27:20,599
Is that so?

765
01:27:20,600 --> 01:27:25,119
-The gold and relics can go to hell!
-Stop there.

766
01:27:29,080 --> 01:27:32,119
You'll do as I say.

767
01:27:32,120 --> 01:27:35,599
Otherwise I'll take everything
you have including your life.

768
01:27:35,600 --> 01:27:39,119
You need to be equal to me...

769
01:27:39,120 --> 01:27:42,599
...in order to bargain with me.

770
01:27:42,600 --> 01:27:48,599
I took Kite from you. I'll give you
Germiyan's Frontier Marketplace,

771
01:27:48,600 --> 01:27:52,119
and Olcaytu Khan's gold.

772
01:27:52,560 --> 01:27:57,599
You will give the Frontier Marketplace, is that so?

773
01:27:58,560 --> 01:28:01,599
It's not right to take something
without giving anything.

774
01:28:07,080 --> 01:28:09,599
Just wait.

775
01:28:11,080 --> 01:28:14,119
I haven't gotten anything yet.

776
01:28:20,560 --> 01:28:24,119
You'll bargain with me first.

777
01:28:42,560 --> 01:28:47,599
Forgive me brothers, we
need to take this marketplace.

778
01:28:54,080 --> 01:28:58,599
May it be easy, alps. Be careful with it.

779
01:29:17,560 --> 01:29:22,119
What's the matter, Konur Bey? Why did you come...

780
01:29:22,560 --> 01:29:25,599
...to the frontier market without knowledge?

781
01:29:30,560 --> 01:29:34,119
We seek no troubles, Kanyumaz.

782
01:29:40,560 --> 01:29:45,119
Kanyumaz, we will take over the frontier market.

783
01:29:49,560 --> 01:29:53,599
Stay back and obey Osman Bey's orders.

784
01:29:54,080 --> 01:29:59,599
What are you talking about? Just go.
away. Or some blood will be shed here.

785
01:30:03,080 --> 01:30:06,599
We have no intention to shed blood, Kanyumaz.

786
01:30:08,560 --> 01:30:10,599
Turn the market over to us.

787
01:30:10,600 --> 01:30:14,119
-Alps!
-Stop!

788
01:30:14,560 --> 01:30:18,119
Stop! Alps, stop!

789
01:30:25,560 --> 01:30:28,119
Brothers.

790
01:30:29,560 --> 01:30:34,119
It's me! Cerkutay!

791
01:30:35,080 --> 01:30:39,599
Cerkutay who protected you in this frontier market.

792
01:30:40,560 --> 01:30:42,599
Do you remember?

793
01:30:42,600 --> 01:30:45,119
Tajeddin Noyan!

794
01:30:46,080 --> 01:30:51,119
...wanted to capture this
market and kill Osman Bey.

795
01:30:52,080 --> 01:30:58,119
What did we do? We played
a great trick against him.

796
01:31:00,080 --> 01:31:04,119
Our next move will be harder.

797
01:31:05,560 --> 01:31:08,119
You trusted me.

798
01:31:09,080 --> 01:31:12,119
Osman Bey...

799
01:31:12,120 --> 01:31:16,599
...appreciates Germiyan alps as
much as he appreciates his own alps!

800
01:31:20,560 --> 01:31:23,119
You believed me.

801
01:31:26,560 --> 01:31:29,119
Believe me again.

802
01:31:33,560 --> 01:31:37,119
Turn the frontier market over to us.

803
01:31:38,560 --> 01:31:42,599
Cerkutay, get out of my way.

804
01:31:44,080 --> 01:31:49,119
Kanyumaz, this is my final word.

805
01:31:50,080 --> 01:31:53,119
you don't do as I say,

806
01:31:53,120 --> 01:31:57,119
...both sides will lose too many.

807
01:31:58,560 --> 01:32:03,119
And you will be responsible
for the blood shed here.

808
01:32:20,080 --> 01:32:23,599
Alps, put your swords down.

809
01:32:38,080 --> 01:32:40,599
Kanyumaz.

810
01:32:41,560 --> 01:32:44,599
Alps will wait in the place we determine.

811
01:32:44,600 --> 01:32:47,599
And people here will go back to their tribes.

812
01:33:03,080 --> 01:33:07,599
-We've brought the gold safely.
-Thank you.

813
01:33:08,080 --> 01:33:11,119
Now we'll wait for Imren Tegin's men.

814
01:33:11,560 --> 01:33:15,119
Take positions accordingly, alps,

815
01:33:30,080 --> 01:33:33,599
What do you want in return for my signs?

816
01:33:41,560 --> 01:33:46,599
You won't let Crusaders come to my lands.

817
01:33:47,080 --> 01:33:50,599
You shouldn't have built your
house on the way of Crusaders.

818
01:33:50,600 --> 01:33:53,119
You shouldn't have lost your sings

819
01:33:56,080 --> 01:33:59,119
You will figure something out.

820
01:34:00,080 --> 01:34:06,119
You will make Crusaders pass
through the lands of Germiyan.

821
01:34:07,560 --> 01:34:11,599
Yakup Bey... Yakup Bey is on campaign now.

822
01:34:12,080 --> 01:34:15,119
They can't resist as strongly as we can.

823
01:34:15,560 --> 01:34:21,119
They'll establish their
headquarters in Kutahya. So...

824
01:34:22,080 --> 01:34:26,119
...Crusaders won’t be able to raid my lands.

825
01:34:28,560 --> 01:34:32,119
When Crusaders leave,

826
01:34:32,560 --> 01:34:35,119
...you will get your signs.

827
01:34:35,120 --> 01:34:41,119
I see now. Devils are watching
you with admiration, Osman Bey.

828
01:34:42,080 --> 01:34:47,119
You'll send Crusaders on
Yakup to get rid of him, huh?

829
01:34:48,080 --> 01:34:52,599
I will do anything to protect my lands.

830
01:34:54,560 --> 01:34:57,599
Don't be worrying.

831
01:35:00,080 --> 01:35:05,119
I can do that. I will guide
Crusaders in these lands.

832
01:35:05,120 --> 01:35:08,599
If you want the signs,

833
01:35:09,080 --> 01:35:12,119
...do what I said.

834
01:35:12,560 --> 01:35:15,119
Your soldiers will go to the frontier market.

835
01:35:15,560 --> 01:35:20,119
They will capture both the market, and the gold.

836
01:35:21,080 --> 01:35:28,599
Fine. What about Mehmed? Isn't he in
the palace? What will you do about him?

837
01:35:33,560 --> 01:35:36,599
It's my concern.

838
01:35:53,080 --> 01:35:57,119
-Welcome, Fitnat.
-Thank you, Gonca Hatun.

839
01:35:57,560 --> 01:36:00,599
-What is that?
-Candaroglu has sent the dowry.

840
01:36:01,080 --> 01:36:04,119
Saadet Hatun sends her regards.

841
01:36:06,080 --> 01:36:09,599
We're going to the market.
Load these on the cart. Come on.

842
01:36:09,600 --> 01:36:12,119
Come on.

843
01:36:14,560 --> 01:36:17,119
Alaaddin.

844
01:36:19,080 --> 01:36:23,599
Come on, Fitnat Hatun. Let's go.

845
01:36:24,080 --> 01:36:26,599
-Let go of me.
-Move.

846
01:36:26,900 --> 01:36:28,129
Aladdin.

847
01:36:31,080 --> 01:36:34,119
Have you considered what I said, Trickster Hatun?

848
01:36:35,080 --> 01:36:38,119
-Let's go talk to my father.
-You're dreaming, Alaaddin.

849
01:36:39,080 --> 01:36:44,599
Nothing would change if we
saw him. He promised Candaroglu.

850
01:36:45,560 --> 01:36:49,599
-He’ll never break his promise.
-Don't do this, Gonca.

851
01:36:49,600 --> 01:36:52,119
I will convince my father.
I'll figure something out.

852
01:36:52,120 --> 01:36:56,119
Alaaddin, there is no solution.

853
01:36:57,080 --> 01:37:00,119
There's no way.

854
01:37:00,560 --> 01:37:06,599
My brother would kill you.
And if he did, I couldn't stand it.

855
01:37:08,560 --> 01:37:13,119
Orhan Bey gave up on Holofira for the state.

856
01:37:16,560 --> 01:37:20,599
-Give up on me.
-No.

857
01:37:20,600 --> 01:37:24,119
I won't give up on you, my hazel-eyed.

858
01:37:25,080 --> 01:37:27,599
-I won't give up on you.
-Gonca Hatun.

859
01:37:28,080 --> 01:37:31,119
-Mehmed Bey is coming.
-Alaaddin, just go.

860
01:37:31,120 --> 01:37:34,599
Just go! Please just go.
-I said I wouldn’t go, Gonca.

861
01:37:34,600 --> 01:37:37,119
Alaaddin f

862
01:37:41,560 --> 01:37:44,599
Didn't I tell you not to get
close to my sister again?

863
01:37:45,080 --> 01:37:47,599
She’s engaged now! Why don't you just get it?

864
01:37:47,600 --> 01:37:50,119
-Mehmed, you are testing my patience!
-Brother, stop.

865
01:37:50,560 --> 01:37:53,599
-I'm already out of patience.
-Brother, stop.

866
01:37:53,600 --> 01:37:57,119
Alps, arrest Mehmed Bey.

867
01:37:57,560 --> 01:38:00,599
What are you talking about, Bala Hatun?

868
01:38:02,080 --> 01:38:04,599
Sisters.

869
01:38:06,080 --> 01:38:10,599
You arrest Gonca Hatun.
Take them to their rooms.

870
01:38:11,080 --> 01:38:13,599
What does that mean, Bala Hatun?

871
01:38:13,600 --> 01:38:17,599
You will be our guests for a while.

872
01:38:22,080 --> 01:38:26,119
What game are you up to
again? You will pay for this!

873
01:38:27,080 --> 01:38:32,599
-Mother, what's going on?
-Osman Bey's orders, son.

874
01:38:32,600 --> 01:38:35,119
Listen to me carefully.

875
01:38:43,080 --> 01:38:49,599
This war, Osman Bey, won't end before
either of us dies. Remember this.

876
01:38:50,560 --> 01:38:55,119
It will end very soon. Don't be worrying.

877
01:38:55,120 --> 01:39:00,599
It will finish between the
dogs behind you and my alps!

878
01:39:01,560 --> 01:39:04,599
While your land's fate depends on my words,

879
01:39:04,600 --> 01:39:07,599
...you are still challenging me.

880
01:39:19,080 --> 01:39:22,599
I've ended the siege of Atronos.

881
01:39:25,560 --> 01:39:29,599
You don't need to get in and out
through holes like a rat anymore.

882
01:39:31,080 --> 01:39:35,599
Come through this gate like a man.

883
01:39:38,080 --> 01:39:41,119
This is the first and last deal I've made with you.

884
01:39:43,080 --> 01:39:48,119
Distract Crusaders and take the signs.

885
01:39:50,080 --> 01:39:55,599
I will take them, Osman Bey. I will. Don’t worry.

886
01:39:56,560 --> 01:40:01,599
Stay safe... Oh... I almost forgot.

887
01:40:02,560 --> 01:40:06,119
Send my regards to Holofira and Olivia.

888
01:40:06,560 --> 01:40:10,119
I’ll kill them too sooner or later.

889
01:40:11,080 --> 01:40:14,119
When I want.

890
01:40:49,560 --> 01:40:52,119
Lotus.

891
01:40:53,080 --> 01:40:56,119
It's beautiful.

892
01:40:57,080 --> 01:41:00,599
You know it lives in the water, right?

893
01:41:00,600 --> 01:41:03,599
If you try to plant it, it dies.

894
01:41:04,080 --> 01:41:06,599
I know.

895
01:41:07,560 --> 01:41:10,119
And I do everything..

896
01:41:10,120 --> 01:41:12,599
-..to keep it alive.
-Maybe this is the most beautiful death.

897
01:41:17,560 --> 01:41:23,599
Being born in water and dying in your lover's soil.

898
01:41:31,080 --> 01:41:34,599
I told you, Orhan.

899
01:41:35,080 --> 01:41:38,119
Lillies live in water.

900
01:41:38,560 --> 01:41:41,599
If you try to plant it in soil..

901
01:41:43,080 --> 01:41:48,599
-..it dies.
-You told me.

902
01:41:49,560 --> 01:41:55,599
You told me, Lord's daughter.
And I told you I will do anything..

903
01:41:56,560 --> 01:42:00,599
..to keep it alive.

904
01:42:01,560 --> 01:42:06,119
Now, I am the same Orhan, Holofira.

905
01:42:06,560 --> 01:42:10,119
The Orhan that loves you.

906
01:42:10,120 --> 01:42:14,119
Bey Orhan, Shahzade Orhan..

907
01:42:14,560 --> 01:42:18,599
..the Orhan that had all
the solutions in his hand..

908
01:42:20,080 --> 01:42:23,119
..but now is hopeless.

909
01:42:25,080 --> 01:42:28,119
My Allah.

910
01:42:29,560 --> 01:42:32,599
Keep us in the right path.

911
01:42:40,080 --> 01:42:44,599
Alps! Pack up!

912
01:43:03,080 --> 01:43:07,119
My Shahzade, I've lost track.

913
01:43:08,080 --> 01:43:12,599
We will find it, those secret passages..

914
01:43:13,080 --> 01:43:16,599
..will be the end of Rome's dog.

915
01:43:16,600 --> 01:43:20,119
Come on!

916
01:43:22,080 --> 01:43:25,599
Osman tricked us.

917
01:43:26,080 --> 01:43:29,119
Brother. Hold it, just wait.

918
01:43:29,560 --> 01:43:32,599
-We will learn when Osman Bey comes.
-What will we learn Gonca?

919
01:43:33,080 --> 01:43:35,599
Osman sold us out. He went to Atranos.

920
01:43:35,600 --> 01:43:38,119
He will make a deal with crusaders.
-Brother.

921
01:43:38,120 --> 01:43:40,599
Osman Bey does not do such a thing.

922
01:43:41,080 --> 01:43:46,599
You trust these Kayis more than us. Why Gonca, why?

923
01:43:46,600 --> 01:43:51,599
I do not trust anyone. I watch
think and decide, brother.

924
01:43:51,600 --> 01:43:54,599
Osman Bey only thinks for the benefit of Turks.

925
01:43:54,600 --> 01:43:57,119
-He does not stab anyone in their back.
-Shut it.

926
01:43:57,560 --> 01:44:00,599
You are blinded.

927
01:44:05,560 --> 01:44:10,599
I am thinking if we are doing
a mistake father, however..

928
01:44:10,600 --> 01:44:13,599
..no one else but that
Byzantinian girl could’ve done this.

929
01:44:13,600 --> 01:44:17,119
Everything will be revealed at the court.

930
01:44:17,120 --> 01:44:21,119
Do not overthink and muddle your mind.

931
01:44:26,080 --> 01:44:29,119
-Elcim..
-Aunt..

932
01:44:30,080 --> 01:44:33,599
My daughter Ayca.

933
01:44:39,080 --> 01:44:41,599
-Ayca.
-Aunt.

934
01:44:42,080 --> 01:44:45,599
-Aunt.
-Go away!

935
01:44:46,080 --> 01:44:48,599
-Go away!
-Aunt’

936
01:44:49,080 --> 01:44:53,119
-No! Go away!
-What is it, my daughter!

937
01:45:02,560 --> 01:45:06,119
Go and bring Alaeddin Bey at once!

938
01:45:09,080 --> 01:45:11,599
My girl.

939
01:45:12,080 --> 01:45:14,999
GERMIYANOGLU BORDER - FRONTIER MARKET

940
01:45:19,080 --> 01:45:23,599
We can deliver the gold for the army
to Frontier Marketplace, however..

941
01:45:23,600 --> 01:45:27,599
-..have a bad feeling about it.
-You are right, my brother.

942
01:45:27,600 --> 01:45:31,599
Imren will grow his power
with Frontier Marketplace..

943
01:45:31,600 --> 01:45:34,119
...and these gold.

944
01:45:34,120 --> 01:45:37,119
Do not worry. Osman Bey..

945
01:45:37,560 --> 01:45:41,119
..will not allow the infidel to have these gold.

946
01:45:41,120 --> 01:45:45,599
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits.

947
01:46:04,560 --> 01:46:09,119
You do not have the intelligence
to calculate all these gold.

948
01:46:09,560 --> 01:46:14,119
The dog of Imren Tegin.

949
01:46:30,560 --> 01:46:34,599
It surprises me how you can even count goats.

950
01:46:46,080 --> 01:46:52,119
Look here. Do you know how we learned calculations?

951
01:46:54,080 --> 01:46:58,599
By counting the heads of the men we killed.

952
01:47:00,560 --> 01:47:06,119
Watch your tongue while you still have your head.

953
01:47:08,560 --> 01:47:13,119
It seems Imren Tegin has been soft on you.

954
01:47:13,560 --> 01:47:16,119
Leave our marketplace..

955
01:47:16,120 --> 01:47:20,599
..before we take your lives here.

956
01:47:32,080 --> 01:47:36,119
..we will meet again.

957
01:47:36,120 --> 01:47:39,119
Dani.. Daniel.

958
01:47:39,120 --> 01:47:41,599
We will meet again.

959
01:47:42,080 --> 01:47:44,599
However, at that time..

960
01:47:45,080 --> 01:47:49,119
..swords will do the talking.

961
01:47:51,080 --> 01:47:55,599
Alps, come on.

962
01:48:18,560 --> 01:48:21,599
Her breath is stabilized.

963
01:48:22,080 --> 01:48:25,599
-Her fever has gone down too.
-Then why isn't she awake?

964
01:48:26,080 --> 01:48:28,599
My Allah, give her cure.

965
01:48:29,080 --> 01:48:32,599
Ulgen Hatun, make her drink this.

966
01:48:33,080 --> 01:48:38,599
-She will get up Gunduz Bey, I hope.
-In the name of Allah, the merciful, the compassionate.

967
01:48:46,080 --> 01:48:50,119
-She is waking up.
-Aunt.

968
01:48:58,080 --> 01:49:02,119
You are alright and will be better,
if Allah permits.

969
01:49:04,560 --> 01:49:08,119
-What happened to me?
-You were poisoned, my girl.

970
01:49:08,120 --> 01:49:10,599
You will be better.

971
01:49:13,560 --> 01:49:17,599
Aunt?

972
01:49:19,560 --> 01:49:22,599
-Stop!
-Let me go!

973
01:49:23,080 --> 01:49:26,119
-Let me!
-Hold her tight Ulgen!

974
01:49:26,560 --> 01:49:29,119
-I will kill myself!
-Hold her!

975
01:49:29,120 --> 01:49:33,119
Do something, Alaeddin Bey!

976
01:49:33,560 --> 01:49:37,119
-Her hand is not opening!
-Let me go!

977
01:49:37,560 --> 01:49:40,599
-I will kill myself!
-Aunt, stop!

978
01:49:40,600 --> 01:49:46,119
-I will kill myself!
-Stay calm!

979
01:49:46,560 --> 01:49:51,119
Stay calm.

980
01:50:00,080 --> 01:50:05,599
-What was this, Alaeddin Bey?
-The poison causes this, Gunduz Bey.

981
01:50:06,560 --> 01:50:09,599
It has disturbed her soul.

982
01:50:12,080 --> 01:50:17,599
-She can do things she never did before.
-Will she stay like this?

983
01:50:22,560 --> 01:50:27,119
Time will tell.

984
01:50:56,080 --> 01:50:59,599
Tell me, what is the situation?

985
01:51:01,080 --> 01:51:03,599
Ayca opened her eyes.

986
01:51:03,600 --> 01:51:07,119
However, her condition is not good.

987
01:51:07,120 --> 01:51:11,599
If I didn't know her, I would've
said she were someone else.

988
01:51:15,560 --> 01:51:20,599
Her body is healing, my Bey. However,
the poison has disturbed her soul.

989
01:51:21,080 --> 01:51:24,119
She will show anger for a while.

990
01:51:24,560 --> 01:51:29,599
Until we find the person who did this,
we will have the same anger, Osman Bey.

991
01:51:31,080 --> 01:51:36,599
Do not worry. Today,
justice will prevail if Allah permits.

992
01:51:57,080 --> 01:51:59,599
Peace be upon you.

993
01:52:06,560 --> 01:52:10,599
You let us visit the Madrasa of Yusuf.

994
01:52:10,600 --> 01:52:15,599
Thank you Holofira Hatun.
-I wanted to thank you, actually.

995
01:52:17,080 --> 01:52:24,599
But... why did you call it a
madrasa? What can you learn here?

996
01:52:27,080 --> 01:52:31,119
Yusuf, peace be with him,
taught the truth and...

997
01:52:31,560 --> 01:52:35,119
... the falsehood to many prisoners here.

998
01:52:36,080 --> 01:52:42,119
Since then, this place has
been named Madrasa of Yusuf.

999
01:52:42,560 --> 01:52:46,119
As for what will be learned...

1000
01:52:46,560 --> 01:52:49,599
...the value of life is taught
to those who aim to take it...

1001
01:52:50,080 --> 01:52:53,119
...the trust to those who betray...

1002
01:52:53,120 --> 01:52:57,599
...and the value of halal to
those who reach out to haram.

1003
01:53:00,560 --> 01:53:05,119
But what if a person already knows these things?

1004
01:53:05,560 --> 01:53:11,119
What if she is accused and thrown into prison...

1005
01:53:11,560 --> 01:53:15,119
...what will she learn?
-I told you...

1006
01:53:15,560 --> 01:53:22,119
Madrasa of Yusuf... Yusuf (PBUH) was also thrown
into prison because of false accusations.

1007
01:53:22,120 --> 01:53:30,119
He was innocent. But there were
things he needed to know and learn.

1008
01:53:30,120 --> 01:53:34,119
Patience and submission to Allah.

1009
01:53:34,560 --> 01:53:39,119
But if a person wants to submit to Allah..

1010
01:53:39,560 --> 01:53:42,119
...they must first know themselves.

1011
01:53:42,120 --> 01:53:46,119
To find oneself, one must give up on oneself.

1012
01:53:46,120 --> 01:53:52,119
The way to reach the truth
is to give up on oneself.

1013
01:53:52,560 --> 01:53:56,119
What remains if you give up on yourself?

1014
01:53:59,600 --> 01:54:03,599
Was there anything else except Him anyway?

1015
01:54:07,080 --> 01:54:11,119
Jesus Christ... He had also given up on himself..

1016
01:54:11,120 --> 01:54:14,599
...do you know that?
-I do.

1017
01:54:15,080 --> 01:54:20,119
Like all the prophets, he
prioritized his ummah over himself.

1018
01:54:20,120 --> 01:54:23,119
Even if there were those among
his ummah who betrayed him...

1019
01:54:23,560 --> 01:54:27,119
...he never gave up on submitting to Allah.

1020
01:54:27,120 --> 01:54:33,599
Now, if you want to find yourself in this prison...

1021
01:54:33,600 --> 01:54:36,599
...if you want to find your Allah...

1022
01:54:37,080 --> 01:54:42,599
...follow the path of the Prophets.
One never loses on that path.

1023
01:54:46,080 --> 01:54:50,119
May Allah be with you.

1024
01:55:13,080 --> 01:55:17,599
It's almost time. Almost.

1025
01:55:18,560 --> 01:55:23,119
The ruthless warriors of the Catalans
have already set up their headquarters.

1026
01:55:23,120 --> 01:55:26,119
Where are they? Why don't
you bring them to the castle?

1027
01:55:26,560 --> 01:55:29,119
Because the Frankish have not come yet.

1028
01:55:31,560 --> 01:55:35,119
-Benjamin.
-Yes, Imren Tegin.

1029
01:55:35,560 --> 01:55:38,599
The Frankish will arrive soon.

1030
01:55:39,080 --> 01:55:43,599
You will welcome them.
They will unite with Catalans.

1031
01:55:45,080 --> 01:55:48,119
I saw them on the battlefield.

1032
01:55:48,120 --> 01:55:53,599
I know how invincible they are.
When Catalans and Franks unite...

1033
01:55:53,600 --> 01:55:58,119
...they will be an army which cannot be defeated.

1034
01:55:58,560 --> 01:56:03,119
Then, Mamluk and Osman..

1035
01:56:04,080 --> 01:56:07,599
They will all kneel before us.

1036
01:56:11,560 --> 01:56:15,599
Sisters... Take Holofira..

1037
01:56:16,080 --> 01:56:20,119
...and Olivia Hatun.

1038
01:56:31,080 --> 01:56:36,119
Orhan! Neither I nor my niece would do
such a thing!

1039
01:56:39,560 --> 01:56:45,599
-Aykurt.
-We will wait for you at the door, my Shahzade.

1040
01:56:59,080 --> 01:57:02,119
Why are you running away from me?

1041
01:57:04,080 --> 01:57:10,119
You cannot help me. I don't
want you to help me anyway.

1042
01:57:12,080 --> 01:57:17,599
Don't you say.... "The finger
cut by sharia does not hurt."

1043
01:57:17,600 --> 01:57:22,599
-What are you saying, Holofira?
-Justice will be secured today.

1044
01:57:22,600 --> 01:57:27,119
We will bow down to our fate.

1045
01:57:28,080 --> 01:57:34,119
Look at me. Look at my face. My fate...

1046
01:57:35,080 --> 01:57:38,119
...you are my fate, Lord's daughter.

1047
01:57:38,560 --> 01:57:43,119
Don't worry now. Soon,
your innocence will be proven.

1048
01:57:44,560 --> 01:57:51,119
Once... I thought the same.

1049
01:57:53,080 --> 01:57:57,599
You were the joy of my heart.

1050
01:58:01,080 --> 01:58:06,119
But I woke up from that dream.
And you should also wake up.

1051
01:58:07,080 --> 01:58:11,119
I don't want to see you again.

1052
01:58:13,080 --> 01:58:19,119
Orhan... Forget me.

1053
01:59:01,560 --> 01:59:05,119
Attention! Osman Bey!

1054
01:59:21,560 --> 01:59:26,599
Olivia... Holofira..
Step forward.

1055
01:59:37,080 --> 01:59:42,599
Olivia... did you try to kill Elcim Hatun and...

1056
01:59:43,080 --> 01:59:46,119
...poison Ayca Hatun? Tell me.

1057
01:59:46,120 --> 01:59:50,119
Malhun Hatun asked me the same question, Osman Bey.

1058
01:59:50,120 --> 01:59:53,119
I did not poison Ayca Hatun.

1059
01:59:53,120 --> 01:59:56,599
Boran! -My Bey...

1060
02:00:04,560 --> 02:00:09,599
Whose ring is this?
-It is my ring.

1061
02:00:10,560 --> 02:00:14,119
But what does this prove?

1062
02:00:15,080 --> 02:00:19,119
The poison in it can prove many things.

1063
02:00:20,080 --> 02:00:25,119
Now tell me...
Where is that poison?

1064
02:00:28,560 --> 02:00:31,119
Then let me tell you.

1065
02:00:31,560 --> 02:00:36,119
Now... it is in Ayca Hatun's veins.

1066
02:00:37,560 --> 02:00:40,599
She is struggling with death.

1067
02:00:43,080 --> 02:00:46,119
Either one of you...

1068
02:00:47,560 --> 02:00:51,119
...put the poison in the water.

1069
02:00:56,560 --> 02:01:00,599
Osman Bey, I've been living like
a hostage since I got your palace.

1070
02:01:00,600 --> 02:01:04,119
I didn't leave the room
without your alps or your sisters.

1071
02:01:04,560 --> 02:01:07,599
I didn't go to that room. You
can ask Malhun Hatun if you want.

1072
02:01:08,560 --> 02:01:13,119
She's right, Osman Bey.
Sisters were with her all the time.

1073
02:01:13,120 --> 02:01:16,599
If someone saw her, tell us.

1074
02:01:21,080 --> 02:01:26,119
Holofira. Now tell me.

1075
02:01:29,560 --> 02:01:34,119
When I heard that they will get married...

1076
02:01:34,560 --> 02:01:38,119
..I couldn't control my anger.

1077
02:01:41,080 --> 02:01:46,119
I wanted to poison Elcim
Hatun but I poisoned Ayca Hatun.

1078
02:01:48,080 --> 02:01:52,599
I regret it, I wish I hadn't done it.

1079
02:01:57,080 --> 02:01:59,599
Murderer.

1080
02:02:00,080 --> 02:02:03,599
-You're a murderer.
-Daughter, no.

1081
02:02:04,080 --> 02:02:09,119
Just stop. This is not a right place for wrath.

1082
02:02:12,080 --> 02:02:16,119
Holofira. Tell me how you did it.

1083
02:02:16,120 --> 02:02:19,599
I knew there was poison in my aunt's ring.

1084
02:02:20,080 --> 02:02:23,599
She would take it out before sleep.

1085
02:02:24,080 --> 02:02:27,119
I took it and she didn’t realize.

1086
02:02:28,080 --> 02:02:31,599
I snuck into Elcim Hatun's room.

1087
02:02:31,600 --> 02:02:34,599
I poured the poison in her water.

1088
02:02:40,560 --> 02:02:43,119
Your confession...

1089
02:02:44,560 --> 02:02:47,599
...and your crime coincide.

1090
02:02:58,080 --> 02:03:01,119
Is there anything else you want to say?

1091
02:03:06,560 --> 02:03:11,119
Holofira wanted to kill Elcim Hatun...

1092
02:03:11,120 --> 02:03:14,119
...but she ended up poison!ng Ayca Hatun.

1093
02:03:19,080 --> 02:03:24,599
Tell me Elcim Hatun, do you have something to say?

1094
02:03:26,560 --> 02:03:31,119
Forgive me for doubting your justice, Osman Bey.

1095
02:03:31,560 --> 02:03:34,119
I want to say that...

1096
02:03:34,560 --> 02:03:40,119
...Holofira said that she regretted it,
and thankfully my sister in law did not die.

1097
02:03:40,120 --> 02:03:43,119
I don't want her to...

1098
02:03:49,080 --> 02:03:51,599
...die.

1099
02:03:52,080 --> 02:03:56,119
I want her banished so she cannot
come to these lands again

1100
02:04:03,080 --> 02:04:06,599
What about you, Gunduz Bey?
Do you have anything to say?

1101
02:04:06,600 --> 02:04:11,119
After my daughter’s mercy, I have nothing to say.

1102
02:04:18,560 --> 02:04:22,599
-Then...
-Stop.

1103
02:04:24,080 --> 02:04:26,119
I haven't talked yet.

1104
02:04:26,120 --> 02:04:29,599
-Ayca
-Yenge? (Sister in law)

1105
02:04:32,560 --> 02:04:36,119
Forgive me, Osman Bey. I interrupted you.

1106
02:04:36,560 --> 02:04:39,119
I have my right to retaliation.

1107
02:04:43,080 --> 02:04:47,119
I will not forgive this
ignoble daughter of lord's.

1108
02:04:48,560 --> 02:04:52,119
I want my right to retaliate.

1109
02:05:24,560 --> 02:05:29,119
Ayca Hatun, is this your final decision?

1110
02:05:29,560 --> 02:05:33,599
This is what the justice requires, mercy...

1111
02:05:33,600 --> 02:05:36,599
...is a holiday for the merciless.

1112
02:05:39,080 --> 02:05:42,119
I want my right to retaliate.

1113
02:06:03,560 --> 02:06:06,119
I'm declaring my decision.

1114
02:06:07,560 --> 02:06:14,119
Holofira wanted to kill Elcim Hatun

1115
02:06:15,080 --> 02:06:19,599
and poisoned Ayca Hatun.

1116
02:06:21,560 --> 02:06:27,119
She said she regretted it,
but her regret...

1117
02:06:28,080 --> 02:06:32,599
...isn't enough
for the victim's mercy.

1118
02:06:33,359 --> 02:06:34,359
So...

1119
02:06:38,080 --> 02:06:41,119
She will pay for...

1120
02:06:43,080 --> 02:06:46,599
...what she did.

1121
02:06:49,080 --> 02:06:52,599
She will be executed with the water...

1122
02:06:54,080 --> 02:06:58,119
...that she poisoned Ayca Hatun.

1123
02:07:14,560 --> 02:07:17,599
There is life in retaliation.

1124
02:07:21,420 --> 02:07:26,119
May my Creator forgive your sins.

1125
02:08:03,560 --> 02:08:06,119
Forgive me.

1126
02:09:32,560 --> 02:09:35,119
Holofira.

1127
02:10:41,080 --> 02:10:44,119
Justice has finally been served.

1128
02:10:44,560 --> 02:10:47,119
Thankfully.

1129
02:10:48,080 --> 02:10:50,599
I wish this hadn't happened.

1130
02:10:50,600 --> 02:10:53,599
But you reap what you sow.

1131
02:10:54,080 --> 02:10:57,599
It was a tough matter, Osman Bey.

1132
02:11:00,560 --> 02:11:03,599
Gunduz Bey!

1133
02:11:04,080 --> 02:11:06,599
The important thing...

1134
02:11:06,600 --> 02:11:10,599
...is to see behind the invisible...

1135
02:11:10,600 --> 02:11:13,599
May my Creator illuminate us.

1136
02:11:25,560 --> 02:11:29,599
My Bey, the pioneer troop of Crusaders is coming.

1137
02:11:30,080 --> 02:11:32,599
Their route leads to Sudibi.

1138
02:11:39,080 --> 02:11:42,599
It leads to Sudibi, is that so?

1139
02:11:43,080 --> 02:11:48,119
Then they will unite with
the others. If they unite,

1140
02:11:48,560 --> 02:11:51,119
it will be pretty hard to separate them.

1141
02:11:55,560 --> 02:11:57,599
Alps!

1142
02:11:57,600 --> 02:12:00,119
Prepare the horses.

1143
02:12:04,080 --> 02:12:06,609
These lands are home to those
who come as a friend...

1144
02:12:06,609 --> 02:12:09,669
...and a grave for those who come with enmity.

1145
02:12:12,434 --> 02:12:16,814
Let them come.
We have lots of land!

1146
02:12:17,948 --> 02:12:21,378
We'll bury them all in this land,
if Allah permits!

1147
02:12:21,621 --> 02:12:34,151
Visit turkision.com for more!